{"words": [{"text": "وَلِيَعْلَمَ", "translation": "And that He (might) make evident"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "نَافَقُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "(are) hypocrites"}, {"text": "وَقِيلَ", "translation": "And it was said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "تَعَالَوْا۟", "translation": "Come"}, {"text": "قَـٰتِلُوا۟", "translation": "fight"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "أَوِ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "ٱدْفَعُوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "defend"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "لَوْ", "translation": "If"}, {"text": "نَعْلَمُ", "translation": "we knew"}, {"text": "قِتَالًۭا", "translation": "fighting"}, {"text": "لَّٱتَّبَعْنَـٰكُمْ ۗ", "translation": "certainly we (would have) followed you"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "They "}, {"text": "لِلْكُفْرِ", "translation": "to disbelief"}, {"text": "يَوْمَئِذٍ", "translation": "that day"}, {"text": "أَقْرَبُ", "translation": "(were) nearer"}, {"text": "مِنْهُمْ", "translation": "than [them]"}, {"text": "لِلْإِيمَـٰنِ ۚ", "translation": "to the faith"}, {"text": "يَقُولُونَ", "translation": "saying"}, {"text": "بِأَفْوَٰهِهِم", "translation": "with their mouths"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "لَيْسَ", "translation": "was not"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "أَعْلَمُ", "translation": "(is) Most Knowing"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "يَكْتُمُونَ", "translation": "they conceal"}], "sahih": "And that He might make evident those who are hypocrites. For it was said to them, \"Come, fight in the way of Allāh or [at least] defend.\" They said, \"If we had known [there would be] battle, we would have followed you.\" They were nearer to disbelief that day than to faith, saying with their mouths what was not in their hearts. And Allāh is most knowing of what they conceal -"}